<title>FINLAND: ICE HOCKEY-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ICE HOCKEY-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>World ice hockey championship medal rounds results on Monday:</p>
<p>United States 4 Czech Republic 3 (1-0 3-1 0-2)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>United States - Bob Beers (2:35), Ted Donato(25:37, 36:44), Chris Marinucci (31:47)</p>
<p>Czech Republic - Vladimir Vujtek (35:48, 41:53), Jiri Dopita ( 42:31)</p>
<p>Penalties: United States 10 minutes, Czech Republic 6</p>
<p>Attendance: 13,149  </p>
<p>Sweden 1 Russia 4 (0-1 0-1 1-2)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Sweden - Anders Carlsson (58:18)</p>
<p>Russia - Alexei Morozov (09:47), Alexei Yashin (39:03), Alexander Prokopyev (40:30), Alexander Barkov (46:20)</p>
<p>Penalties: Sweden 10 minutes, Russia 18</p>
<p>Attendance: 13,262</p>
